      "content": "idk. it just feels like there isn't any point to the noise. everyone's just chasing things that don't matter. i spent so much time seeing what real sacrifice looks like, and now i'm just back here pretending to be one of them. it's exhausting. it feels like i don't belong in the world of the living anymore.",
